[{"title":"读易","author":"陆游","text":"大易中含造化机，王何元未造精微。\n乾坤要自吾身看，卧听鸡鸣起索衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5946,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读易","author":"陆游","text":"揖逊干戈两不知，巢居穴处各熙熙。\n无端凿破乾坤秘，祸始羲皇一画时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5947,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读易二首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"老喜杜门常谢客，病惟读易不迎医。\n冬来更愧乖慵甚，醉过收荞下麦时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5948,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读林逋魏野二处士诗","author":"陆游","text":"君复仲先真隐沦，笔端亦自斡千钧。\n闲中一句终难道，何况市朝名利人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5949,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读经","author":"陆游","text":"半升粟饭养残躯，晨起衣冠读典谟。\n莫谓此生无用处，一身自是一唐虞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5950,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读退之人不知古今马牛而襟裾之句有感","author":"陆游","text":"书生独占世间痴，过计私忧无已时。\n知尽古今成底事，空将血泪向人垂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5951,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读唐人愁诗戏作五首 其四","author":"陆游","text":"我辈情钟不自由，等闲白却九分头。\n此怀岂独骚人事，三百篇中